<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Flavour-led everyday cooking | Savory Taste Journal</title><meta name="description" content="Original, practical inspiration for meaningful shared meals and memorable tables."><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/style.css"><script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-0LY0HY7L01"></script><script>window.dataLayer=window.dataLayer||[];function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments)}gtag('consent','default',{analytics_storage:'denied',ad_storage:'denied'});gtag('js',new Date());gtag('config','G-0LY0HY7L01');</script></head><body><header class="top"><nav class="wrap"><a class="logo" href="index.php">Savory Taste Journal</a><button class="menu" aria-label="Toggle navigation">☰</button><div class="links"><a href="index.php">Home</a><a href="about.html">About</a><a href="collections.html">Meal Ideas</a><a href="blog.html">Journal</a><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></div></nav></header><main><div class="wrap hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">Taste · Texture · Technique</p><h1>Cook by flavour, not by rules.</h1><p>A dark editorial kitchen journal for cooks who want bolder weeknight plates, clearer technique and flexible ideas that still feel entirely their own.</p><a class="btn" href="collections.html">Explore the flavour index</a></div><img src="assets/hero.png" alt="A dramatic table of colourful savoury dishes"></div><section class="paper"><div class="wrap intro reveal"><p class="eyebrow">The taste spectrum</p><div><h2>Salt wakes it up. Acid brings it forward. Texture makes it memorable.</h2><p>Our guides show where flavour comes from, when to layer it and how to correct a plate without relying on complicated recipes or unsupported wellness claims.</p></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Fresh from the journal</p><h2>Three routes into dinner</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card reveal" data-cat="Quick Plates"><span class="tag">Quick Plates</span><h3>The Crispy Chickpea Skillet</h3><p>Build deep flavour quickly with toasted spices, lemon and a cool herb finish.</p><a href="crispy-chickpea-skillet.html">Read the story →</a></article><article class="card reveal" data-cat="Global Flavours"><span class="tag">Global Flavours</span><h3>Miso Mushroom Noodles</h3><p>A weeknight bowl balancing savoury depth, springy noodles and bright greens.</p><a href="miso-mushroom-noodles.html">Read the story →</a></article><article class="card reveal" data-cat="Vegetarian"><span class="tag">Vegetarian</span><h3>Charred Corn over Soft Polenta</h3><p>Sweet smoke, creamy grains and sharp cheese meet in one generous plate.</p><a href="charred-corn-polenta.html">Read the story →</a></article></div></div></section><section class="paper"><div class="wrap feature reveal"><img src="assets/preparation.png" alt="Spices, herbs and vegetables arranged for flavour study"><div><p class="eyebrow">Build the backbone</p><h2>Begin with aroma. Finish with contrast.</h2><p>Toast one aromatic base, choose a deeply savoury element, then finish with brightness and crunch. The framework works across ingredients, seasons and schedules.</p><a class="btn alt" href="blog.html">Read the journal</a></div></div></section></main><footer class="footer"><div class="wrap"><div class="footgrid"><div><h3>Savory Taste Journal</h3><p>Original ideas for meals that feel generous, relaxed and worth remembering.</p></div><div><h3>Explore</h3><a href="about.html">Our approach</a><a href="collections.html">Meal ideas</a><a href="blog.html">Journal</a></div><div><h3>Policies</h3><a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a><a href="terms.html">Terms</a><a href="refund.html">Refund</a><a href="shipping.html">Shipping</a></div><div><h3>Contact</h3><p>hello@savorytastejournal.com</div></div><div class="copy">© 2026 Savory Taste Journal. Editorial guidance only; adapt ingredients for personal dietary needs.</div></div></footer><script sr